  (it needs `./vendor` for `jsonnet -J`): `grafana-upload dashboard-<service>.libsonnet` targets
  LABEU, `--prod` targets EU with a confirmation prompt. Requires `GF_SSO_SESSION` (browser cookie)
  and `GF_USER_AGENT` (that session's User-Agent); `GF_FOLDER_UID` overrides the folder, `-v` dumps
  the payload. Never reference it in files committed to `terraform-grafana`.
